WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.040
<i>Special announcement!</i>

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.530
<i>The distinguished son of the Paprika Group, Shikyouin Hibiki-san,</i>

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.810
<i>returned from Europe yesterday.</i>

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.440
<i>While studying in Europe,</i>

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.320
he flourished as both a movie star and model.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:17.040
Many of his titles have been sold out, making him a legendary artist.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.840
I hope he stays here forever.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.220
It's Shikyouin Hibiki!

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:22.870
The one from TV?!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.930
Really? That movie star?!

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.120
W-Why is he coming to Paprika Academy?!

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.220
Huh?
Hibiki!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.210
What's going on?

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.090
Hibiki-sama, I love you!

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.670
Please marry me!

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:42.360
Hibiki-sama!

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.340
Shikyouin-sama!

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.850
Look over here!

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:47.980
H-i-b-i-k-i-T-V!

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:51.070
Hibiki-sama, you're so beautiful! You're mesmerising!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.310
Pretty cool, isn't he, Leona?

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.110
Yeah.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:55.800
Looks like he's rich, too.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.290
And probably smart as well.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.530
White, yet black. Even better.

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:03.390
Prince-sama...

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.270
Eh?!

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:06.710
That's your Prince-sama?!

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:09.670
But why has he shown up at our school?

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.430
Prince-sama!

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.800
P-Prin...

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.370
Prince-sama...

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:22.270
We have been awaiting your arrival, Shikyouin Hibiki-san.

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:25.230
It has been far too long, Miss Gloria.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:35.970
As a prince raised in Europe, you sure do know how to properly greet someone.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.040
Right Rina-chwan?

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.660
Right-puru!

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.120
I'm honoured to be here.

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:19.200
Prince-sama and the Blue Bird of Misfortune.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.840
Students of Paprika Academy,

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.810
I have an important announcement to make today.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:31.900
Starting today, the distinguished son of the Paprika Group, Shikyouin Hibiki-san,

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.310
will be attending our high school department for one year.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.730
Hooray!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:41.180
Hibiki-san has spent most of his time in Europe.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:44.700
However, he is the grandchild of the academy's chairman.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.660
I see.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.870
As such, he has been given the position of acting principal.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.450
Rina-chan, go!

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.480
Amazing!

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:00.180
Acting principal?

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:01.010
Really?!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.550
I didn't see this coming.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.550
Me either.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.040
Why?

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:09.560
Principal, isn't it strange to have a first year high school student be the acting principal?

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.800
Dorthy...

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.690
It's not strange!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:13.560
That's because...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.230
That's because...?

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:19.960
...he won the Mr. Hunky Universe Prince of the Year contest...

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:24.690
...with his exquisite heart, technique, and physique expected of the ideal male,

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:29.200
and has been crowned the ultimate prince by the queen of the three Plutoniean countries.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.930
Since he's the ultimate prince,

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:37.520
our job will be to spend a whole year like a prince!

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.440
That means we get to ride in a horse-drawn carriage.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:41.380
I can't wait!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:43.630
This will be awesome!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.930
Now then, everyone,

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:52.100
let's do our best to be pure, righteous, and beautiful Paprika Academy students just like Hibiki-san.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.600
Please take care of me.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.770
We'd be glad to!

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.660
What are you doing, Fuwari-chan?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.720
Prince-sama didn't even notice me.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:12.080
He forgot all about me.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:17.330
What's the big idea?!

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.710
Hey, what was that for?!

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.180
Oh,

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.170
I'm sorry.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.700
Ah, well...

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.010
You don't need to cry.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.140
Was it what I said?

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:30.600
No.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.560
Fuwari-chan...

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.020
Eh?!

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:47.740
So you became PriPara's princess scholarship student because Shikyouin-san asked you to?

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.000
Yes.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:53.240
But when you went to talk to him again, he didn't acknowledge you.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:57.680
Speaking of which, what did he say when you first met him?

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:01.030
When I met Prince-sama?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:12.850
I was playing with the goat Yukino-chan and the other animals in the Palps like I always did.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.500
<i>Hello.</i>

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.810
<i>Do you want to sing with me?</i>

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:30.120
<i>All animals are friends.</i>

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.550
<i>Then let's sing together.</i>

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.160
<i>Maxi.</i>

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:58.480
<i>You have a beautiful voice.</i>

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.480
<i>For Maxi to be attracted to someone other than me...</i>

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.740
<i>You must have a pure heart.</i>

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.440
<i>Not at all.</i>

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:10.110
<i>Maxi suddenly ran off when I was letting him get a drink from the river.</i>

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:14.720
<i>Perhaps he was attracted to your voice.</i>

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.120
<i>I've never seen him run that fast.</i>

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:21.330
<i>I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.</i>

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.560
<i>No ending.</i>

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:28.740
<i>If you're looking for somewhere to rest your horse, there's a place on the other side of that road.</i>

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:29.980
<i>What's your name?</i>

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:30.760
<i>Eh?</i>

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.650
<i>It's Fuwari.</i>

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.220
<i>Midorikaze Fuwari.</i>

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:37.030
<i>Fuwari...</i>

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:40.500
<i>Your song was beautiful.</i>

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.720
<i>It seems I've finally found what I've been looking for.</i>

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:43.310
<i>Huh?</i>

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:45.850
<i>My princess.</i>

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.370
Wow! How romantic!

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:59.290
If I was there, he would have said that to me!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.630
How wonderful.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.140
It's the season of Koi.

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:03.920
But that looks like a Tai.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.160
Though, he's right. Midorikaze-san's singing is beautiful.

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:11.260
But I wonder if his heart was cleansed by her lack of a sentence ender?

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.620
What?

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:15.090
Does that upset you, President Minami?

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.050
Of course not!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:20.020
Prez's pri is wonderful the way it is-bri.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.520
And then what?!

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.070
And then...

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:28.620
<i>Since I've been chosen as the ultimate prince,</i>

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:32.450
<i>I've been searching for a suitable ultimate princess.</i>

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.420
<i>Princess?</i>

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:35.360
<i>Right.</i>

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:38.410
<i>So please become my princess.</i>

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:42.640
<i>And to do that, I would like you to go to PriPara on Parajuku St.</i>

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:50.260
<i>You see, I believe that PriPara will bring forth the ultimate girl.</i>

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.800
I said that, and asked her to come here.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.290
I see.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:09:00.480
So by first winning the Summer Idol Dream GrandPrix,

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:03.770
she'll be on her way to becoming the Princess of Summer.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:04.960
Correct.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:09.490
I'm sure she'll shine brighter than anyone else if we polish her.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:14.240
I hear you've had a profound admiration for PriPara for quite some time, Miss Gloria.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:19.700
So please give Fuwari your utmost guidance and encouragement.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.830
Of course!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:28.290
So that's why Fuwari-chan came all the way to Paprika Academy.

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:33.260
But it seems Prince-sama forgot about me.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.550
What? You're burying your PriTicket?!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.470
If you do that, the ghost of wasting will come for you.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.180
But...

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.890
Your collar... pushuu~.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.510
What's this?

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.690
Looks like it's from Prince-sama.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.400
Eh?!

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:54.840
<i>Fuwari, I was so busy I couldn't talk to you today.</i>

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:58.410
<i>But once you've become an elegant princess, I'll come sweep you off your feet.</i>

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.370
<i>Hibiki.</i>

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.930
Prince-sama! I will!

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:06.080
I'll do my best to become an elegant princess!

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:08.720
Isn't that great, Fuwari-chan?

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:12.040
Yeah! I can't wait to perform!

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:16.550
The world is beautiful.

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:19.530
Wow. She really does have a lovely voice.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.510
Yeah.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.480
Time to be quick and decisive.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:26.480
I'll have to act fast and ask her to join Dressing Parfait's Dream Team.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:32.140
I'm sorry, but since we still can't find a brand for Fuwari-san,

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:33.820
she can't have her début concert yet.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.400
Eh?!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.840
What's with that?!

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:39.660
Isn't everyone in PriPara an idol?!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.270
I'm cosmicly sorry!

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:44.430
I'm buried under a teracosmic pile of work.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:46.870
But I'll do my super best to make something soon!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.080
Thanks.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.580
I'll leave it to you.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.600
Cosmic capisce!

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:57.380
What's a manager?

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:00.150
You really don't know anything, do you?

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.390
Please allow me to explain-usa.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.850
T-T-Tori!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.310
Are you okay?

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.020
T-T-T-

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.230
Fuwari.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:14.190
This is Dressing Parfait's manager, Usagi.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.620
Usagi-san?

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:16.700
Usa!

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:20.420
A manager is a must-have for every idol here in PriPara.

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:22.780
You could say their importance is akin to that of air-usa.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.900
Animals wouldn't be able to live without air.

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:30.000
So a manager is truly important.

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.670
T-T-

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.300
I feel refreshed-kuma.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:45.930
Yeah! Yeah!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:49.470
Is everyone as excited as I am-usa?

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.780
Ack! What's that?!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.620
There's a visible silhouette around it!

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.700
Who's that bird?

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.830
That's Toriko-san-kuma.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:11.830
Toriko-san?

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.040
Kuma...

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.250
And since she's drowning in misfortune,

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:18.210
she has come to be known as the Blue Bird of Misfortune.

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:21.090
T-The Blue Bird of Misfortune?!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.050
Usa...

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:26.550
Misfortune seems to follow her wherever she goes-usa.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.020
But...

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:31.500
Because of that, everyone avoids her which means she's always alone-usa.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.520
So it's best not to associate with her-usa.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:37.480
But all animals are friends.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.440
Toriko-san, let's become friends, too.

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:41.900
Tori...

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.800
If you speak in bird I won't be able to understand you.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.450
Toriko can speak normally-tori.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.080
Toriko only brings misfortune to those around her-tori!

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.540
Wait!

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:58.280
I'd like to try talking to Toriko-san.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.210
Ah, Fuwari-chan!

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:05.220
Toriko-san!

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.180
She flew off in this direction.

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:15.770
Ah, over there!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:16.960
Eh?!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.400
Huh? Where?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.480
Who knows.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.190
She must have hawk eyes.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.450
Toriko-san!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:28.640
Lightning out of nowhere?!

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.390
This sure is some strange weather...

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:31.910
You okay?

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.620
Porapora.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.110
Don't worry, I'm fine.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:38.170
Ouch!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:39.810
Washbin lightning?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:41.520
We're really having some strange weather...

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:42.840
Are you okay?!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.000
See!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:47.210
I told you that Toriko brings misfortune to those that go near her-tori!

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:50.260
Don't worry, I'm hardheaded.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:55.230
Did you come here with the thought of eating Toriko?

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.210
Making grilled bird out of me-tori?!

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:59.440
I'm sure you'd like it with sauce and salt-tori!

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.580
No.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.400
I want to be friends.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.080
You say you want to be friends,

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.620
but as soon as I let my guard down,
you'll end up making fried bird out of me!

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:11.370
Wow. She's always thinking negatively.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.890
Happy go lucky!

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:16.830
I believe if you laugh and have fun, happiness will follow.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.330
Yeah.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:20.640
Laugh, you say?

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.680
That's quite a dark laugh you have there...

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.010
Dorthy...

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.850
That's right, Toriko is Toriko.

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.470
Living alone in the darkness suits Toriko the best-tori.

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:34.430
Ah, wait!

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.390
Toriko-san!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.690
Please wait up!

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:43.820
Tori?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.450
Tori?!

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.780
Like Toriko said-tori.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:56.080
Misfortune falls upon those who come near her-tori.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.670
Ack, she's floating away-tori!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:04.000
G-Grab ahold of this-tori!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.130
Thanks.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:07.720
Tori!

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:08.900
I'm sorry.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.550
Toriko can't swim-tori!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.740
Farewell.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:21.580
May this Toriko of Misfortune be released from her calamity, and become a star up in the sky.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:32.820
Are you okay?

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:34.930
You shouldn't have-tori.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:37.050
You should leave Toriko behind-tori.

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.890
Otherwise more misfortune will befall you-tori.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.600
That won't happen.

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:45.880
They're coming-tori!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:48.210
The demons of misfortune have come to take us away-tori!

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.210
Just <i>who</i> are demons of misfortune?!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:51.040
Come on!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:54.430
Blue Bird of Misfortune really does suit you!

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:59.770
However, because of all this, I've been able to get closer to you, Toriko-san.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:01.880
Why-tori?!

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:04.100
Why won't you leave Toriko alone-tori?!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:07.320
That's because all animals are friends.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.490
Since we both got soaked in the same river, we're already friends.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:16.490
You really... won't come to hate Toriko?

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.200
I won't.

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:21.660
Are you sure you want to be friends with Toriko?

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.870
Absolutely.

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.590
Even if misfortune befalls you?

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:28.790
That won't happen.

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:34.250
I've decided-tori!

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:38.800
Toriko will be your manager-tori!

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:41.600
I'm Midorikaze Fuwari.

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.250
I look forward to working with you.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.310
Same here-tori.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.890
Fuwari...

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.230
Let me give you your PriPass-tori.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.370
With this, you've become a PriPara idol-tori!

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:55.830
That's ancient! Does it even work?

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.280
Well, Toriko has never been a manager before...

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.160
Actually, it would be better if you didn't-

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.710
Thanks, Toriko-san.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.290
Tori!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.840
And this case is closed peacefully!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.510
Yep!

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:12.850
Tori!
Yeah.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:18.270
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.430
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.030
Coord Change Start!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.450
Thank you for waiting.

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:32.800
It's finally time for everyone to see Dressing Parfait's ninja coord!

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:33.770
Nin! Nin!

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:34.780
In The Water Coord!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.320
Go!

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.850
Even though they're ninjas, they want to stand out!

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:43.340
They're going against the grain and using vibrant colours!

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.170
Nin! Nin!

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.620
In the Woods Coord!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.830
Yeah!

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:53.010
And let's dance with a fluttering scarf completely covered in hearts!

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.530
Nin! Nin!

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:55.670
In the Fire Coord!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:19.380
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.220
Drums!

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:31.110
Guitar!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.180
Bass!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:41.140
Stereo at full blast! 2x3 Rock!

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:43.640
Let's Go!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.480
Cyalume Change!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.460
Go!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.730
The three of them shine so brightly.

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:35.960
It really gets me excited!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.440
Thanks!

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:38.930
Way to Go!

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:43.260
Thanks for everything today.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:46.220
I just can't wait to début!

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:48.220
Then let's snap!

00:20:49.550 --> 00:20:52.930
I don't have any more PriTickets.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.840
I did it with Lala yesterday.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:55.480
What?!

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:56.310
You shouldn't snap your PriTicket with them!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:57.980
We're looking forward to your début, Fuwari-chan!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:59.110
You would've been much better off snapping with us.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:20:59.880
Yeah.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:00.480
You would've been much better off snapping with us.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.250
Okay.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:04.220
I guess you'll be waiting too, Toriko-san.

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:07.610
I've never heard of an idol without a brand-tori.

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:11.450
Toriko really is the Bird of Misfortune-tori!

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:23.050
Sweet dreams, Prince-sama.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:27.600
Good night, Toriko-san.

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:09.000
Fuwari-chan, your princess training looks intense.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:10.360
But I'll do my best.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.330
I want to live up to Hibiki-sama's expectation.

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:14.580
Big news!

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:18.250
The new brand we've been waiting for has finally been finished!

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.640
That means you can finally have your concert!

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:21.450
Yeah.

00:23:21.450 --> 00:23:23.120
I want to stand on stage as soon as I can!

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:25.460
Toriko's so excited that her heart might stop beating!

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:27.670
Toriko'll be grilled bird soon-tori!

00:23:28.450 --> 00:23:29.390
Next time:

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:31.830
Fuwari dances! Her first concert-tori!

00:23:31.830 --> 00:23:33.120
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:34.680
Let's go PriPara!
